se,"id":1345476,"name":"Theodore Robinson (3)"},{"active":true,"id":1920172,"name":"Bobby Lee Fears"}],"namevariations":["OP","Ochio Players","Offio Players","Ohio Player","Players","The Ohio Players","オハイオ・プレイヤーズ"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/48413-Ohio-Players","type":"artist","urls":["http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ohio_Players","http://www.allmusic.com/artist/p5062","https://www.facebook.com/OhioPlayers","http://www.whosampled.com/Ohio-Players/sampled/","https://www.instagram.com/ohioplayersofficial/?hl=en"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/5386340/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"5386340","image":"","imageThumb":"","profile":"","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:5386340","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/5386340-KXNGS","type":"artist","urls":[]}},"/api/discogs/artist/55594/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"55594","image":"https://i.discogs.com/dz0ifnc3L6sGJkoxC3GuJCnF728lCp7FdWgwuONrR3k/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:353/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTU1NTk0/LTE1OTY1NzUzNTQt/MTgwNy5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/NFXwEDCGSey1YKIB_jKywcrPHagsYn2LIguU4N-YbGo/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTU1NTk0/LTE1OTY1NzUzNTQt/MTgwNy5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"American R&B/Disco female vocal group best known for recording the hit song [b]Which Way Is Up[/b] produced by [a=Norman Whitfield] and [a=Mark Davis (2)].  This release was the title track and main theme song from [a=Richard Pryor]'s movie soundtrack for [b]\"Which Way Is Up.\"[/b]  And they also included this track on the their self-titled debut album, [i]Stargard[/i], which spent two weeks at 'Number One' on the Billboard R&B charts in February, 1978.  Stargard's hit single also peaked at number twenty-one on the Billboard Hot 100 singles charts and number twelve on the Disco charts.\r\n","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:55594","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":[{"active":true,"id":377619,"name":"Rochelle Runnells"},{"active":true,"id":927568,"name":"Janice Williams"},{"active":false,"id":1079085,"name":"Debra Anderson"}],"namevariations":["Starguard","スターガード"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/55594-Stargard","type":"artist","urls":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stargard_(group)","http://www.soulwalking.co.uk/Stargard.html"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/7178622/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"7178622","image":"https://i.discogs.com/Z_QREwwAhwId52V0vzIihcDn3rSxweEvJpnpjz5PSnI/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:400/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTcxNzg2/MjItMTc3ODIyOTAw/Ny04MzQ2LmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/htiEFlT6n_80zR5ZFhPhiAsibXTpxT-wORhPbfsAn94/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTcxNzg2/MjItMTc3ODIyOTAw/Ny04MzQ2LmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"Polygonia represents a multidisciplinary music and art project conceived by Lindsey Wang from Munich, Germany.\r\nThe soundscape of her own productions conveys a mystical, organic character and is characterized by driving complex rhythms. Polygonia’s sound palette ranges from energetic, dark deep techno to downtempo, grey area to textural and/or harmonic ambient. In addition, motifs from nature play a major role in many of her productions.\r\nHer DJ and live sets are characterized by a hypnotizing effect that invites you to completely lose yourself in the complex world of sounds for a longer\r\nperiod of time.\r\nShe has already played gigs at venues such as Blitz Club (Munich, DE), Tresor (Berlin, DE), About Blank (Berlin, DE), Positive Education Festival (St. Etienne, FR), Freedom Festival (Medellín, COL), Monument Festival (Oslo, NO) and many more. \r\nTogether with the artists Dycide and MTRL, she established her collective and label IO in 2018. In 2021, Polygonia launched the collaborative band project Lyder with the musicians Niklas Bühler and Moritz Stahl, focusing on the fusion of jazz and electronic music. In July 2022, she founded her own label QEONE.\r\nIn addition, she manages the premiere and podcast platform Hadal Resonance.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:7178622","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":7178786,"name":"Lindsey Wang"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/7178622-Polygonia","type":"artist","urls":["https://polygonia.bandcamp.com/","https://polygonia-io.bandcamp.com/music","https://soundcloud.com/polygonia","https://www.instagram.com/_polygonia_/","https://open.spotify.com/artist/1bvMkEwyURFPl2eDGZieUm","https://www.residentadvisor.net/dj/polygonia","https://polygonia-creations.com/","https://www.facebook.com/polygoniamusicandart","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8CDHu4Ip9k9bov3kr-M6iQ/featured?view_as=subscriber"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/7210462/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"7210462","image":"https://i.discogs.com/8yxvC8rRTYAqfGa0f5vGA4ox4lj-IsVKZqsRqltbG1Q/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:399/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTcyMTA0/NjItMTU2MDMyMDU3/OS05MjM2LmpwZWc.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/J-eGHbdN8iQ-pmU0mNuGRPNgm2T2pJ0ua-QphwDEx4s/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTcyMTA0/NjItMTU2MDMyMDU3/OS05MjM2LmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"Irish Neo-soul singer and rapper, based in London. Signed to RCA Records on June 2019.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:7210462","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/7210462-Biig-Piig","type":"artist","urls":["https://www.biig-piig.com/","https://soundcloud.com/biiggpiigg","https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCknUiQbBajFvNEC0iI28BGQ?&ab_channel=BiigPiig","https://www.facebook.com/biiggpiigg/","https://www.instagram.com/biig_piig/"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/7262831/profile